  "testId": "testClasses.webstore.shoppingCart.BundleProductShoppingCartPageTest#bundleProductVerifyShoppingCartPageDetails",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "Guest searches the bundle product, opens its PDP, types a personalization text into the AdditionalInformation field and adds it to the cart; on the cart page verifies the buttons, line item name, unit and total price, personalization line, product image, the included (free) bundle products, then removes all items and checks the empty-cart message.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore (guest)",
      "Search the bundle SKU and open the first result",
      "Type the personalization text (AdditionalInformation field) and Add to Cart",
      "Open the cart",
      "Verify Continue Shopping and Checkout",
      "Verify line item name, unit price and total price (price x initial quantity)",
      "Verify the personalization line '<label> : <text>'",
      "Verify the line item image against the stored DeWalt bundle image",
      "Verify the included bundle products text",
      "Verify the Remove all items link label",
      "Click Remove all items",
      "Verify the empty cart message"
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "store",
      "product",
      "cart"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "Guest cart: the bundle is added with a personalization text, then all items are removed"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "Continue Shopping and Checkout are visible",
      "Line item name equals the product name",
      "Unit price equals the bundle price",
      "Total price equals unit price x initial quantity",
      "Line item shows 'AdditionalInformation : <typed text>'",
      "Line item image is visible with a non-empty src (structural, after migration)",
      "Included products text lists 'Qty: <n> | <child SKU> - <child name>' per child plus the personalization line",
      "Remove all items label and the empty-cart message"
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Method name and comment: cart page details for a bundle (buttons, name, prices, personalization, image, included products, remove all).",
      "The personalization input locator is fixed to data-test-selector txtProductPersonalizationAdditionalinformation, so the need pins personalizationAttribute AdditionalInformation (minPersonalizableAttributes 1).",
      "The cart unit price is the effective price: ProductSalesPrice '$500.00' -> product.price (COALESCE(sales, retail) on the store's first price list).",
      "PersonalizeLabel 'AdditionalInformation' -> product.personalizationCode (equal to the pinned attribute code). The typed text 'DisplaySampleText' is chosen by the test: config.",
      "FreeBundleProduct is composed: one line 'Qty: <childNBundleQty> | <childNSku> - <childNName>' per child (child1..3 outputs, display order) and a last line '<personalizationCode> : <typed text>'; it stays data without output and the migrated test builds it. The key returns at most 3 children; a resolved bundle with more children would not match.",
      "Image check becomes structural when migrated (user decision 2026-11-04): verifyBundleProductImage asserts only that the line item image is visible with a non-empty src; the stored image file constant is config and no longer tied to the recorded product. No need.",
      "Profile (Playwright observations): z-1234579 is an active BundleProduct in PRODUCTION, inventory 28362, required add-ons 0.",
      "Store: openWebstoreUrl opens automation_webStoreUrl (atstage: webstore-z10-atstage, the main store MaxwellsHardware; centralizedLoginEnabled=no), the same store as the Playwright webstore entries. Guest flow, no sign-in.",
      "Profile: work/profiles/profile.json (2026-11-01) was not run for these Selenium tests (profiled false); Playwright observations of the same SKUs are cited where they exist.",
      "Scanned constant values (locators, report messages, delays) are framework constants: role config, no need.",
      "migrate: Selenium reads Excel tables through TestData.getMap; there is no swap for Selenium."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium"
  },
  "requires": [
    {
      "key": "PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IN_STOCK",
      "alias": "product",
      "params": {
        "quantityUsed": 1,
        "minAddOns": 0,
        "minPersonalizableAttributes": 1,
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "personalizationAttribute": "AdditionalInformation"
      },
      "preferred": {
        "source": 1,
        "required": false
      }
    }
  ],
